  eCoreDrop: 50
  description: "Rustplate was once a maintenance drone coated with adaptive bio-alloy.
    When organic matter fused with its chassis during the disaster, the alloy began
    growing instead of corroding. The creature\u2019s armor continuously regenerates,
    fed by ambient metal and debris. It is a fusion of abandoned machinery and uncontrolled
    biological adaptation."
  vnDescription: "Rustplate t\u1EEBng l\xE0 m\u1ED9t m\xE1y bay kh\xF4ng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
    l\xE1i b\u1EA3o d\u01B0\u1EE1ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\u1EE7 m\u1ED9t l\u1EDBp
    h\u1EE3p kim sinh h\u1ECDc th\xEDch \u1EE9ng. Khi v\u1EADt ch\u1EA5t h\u1EEFu
    c\u01A1 h\xF2a nh\u1EADp v\xE0o khung m\xE1y trong th\u1EA3m h\u1ECDa, h\u1EE3p
    kim b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u ph\xE1t tri\u1EC3n thay v\xEC b\u1ECB \u0103n m\xF2n.
    L\u1EDBp gi\xE1p c\u1EE7a sinh v\u1EADt n\xE0y li\xEAn t\u1EE5c t\xE1i t\u1EA1o,
    \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c nu\xF4i d\u01B0\u1EE1ng b\u1EDFi kim lo\u1EA1i v\xE0 m\u1EA3nh
    v\u1EE5n xung quanh. N\xF3 l\xE0 s\u1EF1 k\u1EBFt h\u1EE3p gi\u1EEFa m\xE1y m\xF3c
    b\u1ECB b\u1ECF hoang v\xE0 s\u1EF1 th\xEDch nghi sinh h\u1ECDc kh\xF4ng ki\u1EC3m
    so\xE1t."
